{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36304","headline":"送缙陵王少府赴举 · 方干","name":"送缙陵王少府赴举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相看不忍尽离觞，五两牵风速去樯。\n远驿新砧应弄月，初程残角未吹霜。\n越山直下分吴苑，淮水横流入楚乡。\n珍重郄家好兄弟，明年禄位在何方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36304.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36304","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}